==Icelandic==
{{wikipedia|lang=is}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|vetr||winter, year}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*wintruz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈvɛːtʏr/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|ɛːtʏr}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|vetrar|vetur}}

# [[winter]], [[wintertime]]
#: '''''Veturinn''' er loksins kominn!''
#:: '''Winter''' has finally arrived!
#: '''''Vetur''' er í [[nánd]]''
#:: '''Winter''' is close.
# [[year]] (counting age)
#: ''Barnið er fimm '''vetra''' gamalt.''
#:: The child is five '''years''' old.

====Declension====
{{is-decl-noun-vetur}}

