* {{l|is|fimbulvetur}}
{{der-mid}}
* {{l|is|í vetur sem leið}} (last winter)
* {{l|is|í vetur}} (this winter)
* {{l|is|vetrarbraut}} (winter road, [[Milky Way]], Galaxy)
